{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53812","headline":"七夕 · 白居易","name":"七夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆得少年长乞巧，竹竿头上愿丝多。\n（见《日本古典文学大系》七三册藤原公任《和汉朗咏集》卷上《七夕》）（〖1〗川口久雄校注云：「《佳句·七夕》题作『《七夕》，白』。\n《全唐诗》、《文集》、《全唐诗逸》均未见。\n当爲在中国已散逸而在我国流传下来的白诗断句。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}